WEBVTT

01:30.870 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.070 --> 01:37.960
[Episode 34]

01:38.120 --> 01:39.000
The people of Nantong

01:39.000 --> 01:40.789
no longer have to flee,

01:41.350 --> 01:43.280
and the salt industry of Lianghuai
no longer

01:43.280 --> 01:45.610
has to worry about being crushed anymore.

01:46.350 --> 01:48.700
All of this is thanks to Your Excellency.

01:49.310 --> 01:51.440
I'd like to raise a toast in your honor.

01:55.560 --> 01:57.350
As expected from Li Million.

01:58.070 --> 02:01.070
Every time he opens his mouth,
it's all business talk.

02:01.880 --> 02:03.880
Well, he's a businessman after all.

02:04.290 --> 02:06.290
What else would he be talking about?

02:06.770 --> 02:07.970
By the way, everyone,

02:08.030 --> 02:09.840
there's still one guest
who hasn't arrived yet.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.590
Let's wait until everyone is seated

02:11.590 --> 02:13.720
before we discuss matters at leisure.

02:15.150 --> 02:16.210
Who else is coming?

02:17.079 --> 02:18.010
What's the rush?

02:18.560 --> 02:20.910
Even I, the Viceroy of Liangjiang,
am waiting patiently.

02:20.910 --> 02:22.440
Look how impatient you are.

02:23.700 --> 02:24.400
Your Excellency,

02:24.400 --> 02:25.760
your honored guest has arrived.

02:25.760 --> 02:26.890
Quick, bring her in.

02:27.240 --> 02:27.700
Come on.

02:27.800 --> 02:28.910
Honored guest.

02:35.329 --> 02:36.650
Greetings, Old Madam.

02:38.300 --> 02:40.030
Your Excellency, my respects.

02:40.290 --> 02:40.710
This is unnecessary.

02:40.710 --> 02:41.079
I cannot accept this.

02:41.079 --> 02:42.910
-Mother.
-Please, get up.

02:47.360 --> 02:48.840
Master, are you alright?

02:51.020 --> 02:52.960
Mr. Gu is the Pacification Commissioner

02:52.960 --> 02:54.750
appointed by the imperial court,

02:54.750 --> 02:56.150
and we're also preparing

02:56.190 --> 02:58.430
to restore his scholar status right now.

02:58.430 --> 03:01.430
Mr. Gu has rendered great service
this time.

03:01.590 --> 03:02.400
Old Madam Gu,

03:02.750 --> 03:04.520
you will surely be granted a noble title.

03:04.520 --> 03:06.520
You don't have to salute officials.

03:06.580 --> 03:07.040
Please.

03:07.590 --> 03:08.000
Please be seated.

03:08.000 --> 03:09.560
Thank you, Your Excellency.

03:09.560 --> 03:11.690
I was staying at home just fine,

03:11.910 --> 03:13.790
yet they came out of nowhere

03:13.870 --> 03:16.400
and just dragged me here
without even asking.

03:23.690 --> 03:24.820
Come on, sit here.

03:25.550 --> 03:26.370
Old Madam.

03:27.310 --> 03:28.240
Today

03:28.270 --> 03:29.430
is the auspicious day of the completion

03:29.430 --> 03:31.120
of the Nantong coastal embankment.

03:31.120 --> 03:33.320
Please join us for a celebratory drink.

03:34.310 --> 03:36.170
My legs aren't in good condition,

03:36.230 --> 03:38.690
so I haven't been to
the coastal embankment.

03:39.640 --> 03:40.960
But my kid

03:41.630 --> 03:42.590
has been working nearby

03:42.590 --> 03:45.150
for months and hasn't gone home once,

03:45.790 --> 03:47.790
which shows his dedication to work.

03:48.620 --> 03:50.640
Still, this isn't his credit.

03:51.710 --> 03:53.340
I just saw

03:53.470 --> 03:55.450
those young men
working on the river project,

03:55.450 --> 03:56.810
sweating and bleeding.

03:57.030 --> 03:59.470
Those are the ones who truly
deserve the credit.

03:59.470 --> 04:00.490
I hope that Your Excellency

04:00.490 --> 04:02.320
can reward them properly.

04:02.750 --> 04:04.350
Old Madam, your words

04:04.430 --> 04:06.290
truly show a heart of compassion.

04:06.590 --> 04:08.240
I've learned a lot.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.560
You don't have to finish this cup of wine.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.750
Just a sip will do.

04:14.670 --> 04:16.000
That's enough, Mother.

04:16.730 --> 04:17.730
Please be seated.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.279
Everyone.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.270
Old Madam here—

04:23.190 --> 04:24.990
first her husband went missing,

04:25.800 --> 04:26.620
and she raised her son

04:26.620 --> 04:28.440
all on her own.

04:28.680 --> 04:31.680
Later, her son was framed by villains
during the imperial exam

04:31.680 --> 04:33.440
and exiled to Ningguta.

04:33.870 --> 04:35.370
For Mr. Gu

04:35.480 --> 04:37.010
to achieve what he has today

04:37.680 --> 04:40.300
is entirely thanks to her.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.830
Now, don't you think it's proper

04:42.960 --> 04:44.159
for me to have invited
such an honored guest?

04:44.159 --> 04:45.159
It's only proper.

04:51.240 --> 04:51.900
Li Million.

04:53.610 --> 04:55.050
This is my honored guest.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.750
How can you not toast her?

04:56.770 --> 04:57.770
Come on. Hurry up.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.390
Go offer her a toast. Come on.

04:59.390 --> 04:59.990
All right.

05:04.830 --> 05:05.920
Here, just hold the cup.

05:05.920 --> 05:06.450
Alright.

05:08.430 --> 05:10.890
I, Li Million, pay my respects
to you, Madam.

05:12.870 --> 05:13.480
Who?

05:22.480 --> 05:23.950
What's your name?

05:24.480 --> 05:24.940
Mother,

05:25.240 --> 05:26.630
he's Li Million,
the wealthiest man in the capital...

05:26.630 --> 05:27.360
Shut up!

05:34.620 --> 05:36.159
May I ask

05:37.630 --> 05:38.950
your name, Sir?

05:45.520 --> 05:47.840
I am Li Million.

05:49.960 --> 05:51.420
My respects to you, Madam.

05:53.190 --> 05:53.650
Mother!

05:59.270 --> 05:59.730
Father.

06:11.760 --> 06:12.370
Mother,

06:12.870 --> 06:13.670
what's wrong?

06:16.230 --> 06:17.270
I haven't

06:19.530 --> 06:21.700
had a drink in decades.

06:23.600 --> 06:27.180
I actually got myself drunk today.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.790
What have you got

06:39.810 --> 06:41.220
up your sleeve?

06:42.180 --> 06:43.180
You have no idea—

06:43.210 --> 06:44.210
I've got something

06:44.210 --> 06:46.159
specially to deal with Li Baiwan.

06:49.830 --> 06:51.050
Old Madam.

06:51.380 --> 06:52.580
Please get some rest.

07:11.660 --> 07:12.160
Wait.

07:13.960 --> 07:14.600
Why?

07:14.630 --> 07:15.450
Didn't we just unload these?

07:15.450 --> 07:16.510
Why are we putting them back up?

07:16.510 --> 07:17.120
Young Master,

07:17.120 --> 07:18.380
it was Master's order.

07:19.150 --> 07:19.500
M...

07:20.150 --> 07:21.440
Master's order?

07:29.680 --> 07:30.340
Your mother

07:30.480 --> 07:31.720
is having acupuncture right now.

07:31.720 --> 07:32.380
Don't go in.

07:32.560 --> 07:33.800
How is my mother doing?

07:33.800 --> 07:35.130
I was meaning to ask you.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.480
Why haven't you told us

07:36.510 --> 07:37.630
what happened to your mother?

07:37.630 --> 07:38.640
I have no idea.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.100
I wanted to ask you.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.920
Ever since your mother came back,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.080
who knows why,

07:44.310 --> 07:46.840
but she's been unconscious
and won't wake up.

07:48.480 --> 07:48.940
Doctor.

07:49.710 --> 07:50.810
Doctor, please.

07:51.000 --> 07:51.600
All right.

07:55.710 --> 07:57.120
Don't go in and disturb her.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.680
Let's speak softly out here.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.070
Alright.

07:59.070 --> 07:59.800
Speak softly.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.330
Alright.

08:07.720 --> 08:08.240
Doctor,

08:08.950 --> 08:10.210
how is my mother doing?

08:10.480 --> 08:11.550
This illness

08:12.240 --> 08:13.520
is very strange.

08:14.190 --> 08:15.920
Judging from her pulse,

08:16.870 --> 08:18.280
her spirit is damaged

08:18.750 --> 08:20.800
and all 5 meridians are injured.

08:23.070 --> 08:25.710
Only a sudden surge of

08:25.870 --> 08:27.070
extreme joy or sorrow

08:27.370 --> 08:29.030
could cause such a condition.

08:30.480 --> 08:32.110
That's odd.

08:32.909 --> 08:34.370
I'll write a prescription

08:34.549 --> 08:36.610
to protect her heart meridian first.

08:38.100 --> 08:38.669
Doctor,

08:39.030 --> 08:40.440
so it can only be protected

08:40.440 --> 08:41.240
but not cured?

08:43.669 --> 08:44.870
This is an illness of the heart,

08:44.870 --> 08:47.130
so only a remedy for the heart
can cure it.

08:48.030 --> 08:48.670
Mr. Gu,

08:49.390 --> 08:51.170
I still need you to tell me

08:51.300 --> 08:52.030
what exactly

08:52.200 --> 08:53.440
happened.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.750
What on earth happened?

08:55.750 --> 08:57.000
Right, what happened?

08:57.000 --> 08:58.750
Tell us the details.

09:08.510 --> 09:15.270
[Virtue as the Foundation]

09:08.550 --> 09:09.350
Young Master.

09:10.420 --> 09:11.910
Why are you stopping... Stopping me?

09:11.910 --> 09:12.710
Young Master.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.600
Come with me.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.000
Don't pull me.

09:16.840 --> 09:17.170
Wait.

09:17.320 --> 09:18.080
What happened exactly?

09:18.080 --> 09:19.250
Wasn't everything fine just now?

09:19.250 --> 09:20.030
We'd take Jiangsu

09:20.030 --> 09:21.140
and leave the rest to Gu Pingyuan, right?

09:21.140 --> 09:21.840
Why is he

09:21.870 --> 09:23.550
suddenly giving them the cold shoulder?

09:23.550 --> 09:24.670
How would I know?

09:24.690 --> 09:25.690
So you don't know?

09:28.850 --> 09:30.900
[Tranquility of Autumn]

09:31.910 --> 09:32.360
Yu'er.

09:34.270 --> 09:35.170
Yu'er.

09:35.750 --> 09:36.270
Yu'er.

09:36.570 --> 09:38.100
Let me take over for a while.

09:38.750 --> 09:40.030
Staying up all day and night—

09:40.030 --> 09:42.510
even a person made of iron
couldn't endure that.

09:42.510 --> 09:43.910
Pingyuan went out again?

09:48.000 --> 09:49.660
Always picking the wrong thing to say.

09:49.660 --> 09:51.120
Come help me with the work.

09:51.150 --> 09:52.350
Pingyuan has guests.

09:52.480 --> 09:54.120
You're all so accommodating to him now.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.580
He has guests all day long.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.390
Who are these people anyway?

09:57.810 --> 09:59.390
They're former salt merchants
from Yangzhou,

09:59.390 --> 10:00.520
here to ask for help.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.630
I've gone in to make tea for them twice,

10:02.630 --> 10:04.390
and all they do is brag.

10:04.790 --> 10:05.940
Your brother has been up all night.

10:05.940 --> 10:07.000
Don't disturb him.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.570
What are you doing?

10:25.480 --> 10:26.290
Was I, Gu Pingwen,

10:26.290 --> 10:27.730
just born to work?

10:28.930 --> 10:29.610
Pingwen.

10:30.790 --> 10:32.040
Behave yourself.

10:33.850 --> 10:34.570
Mr. Gu.

10:34.810 --> 10:36.380
My family has been in the salt business
for generations.

10:36.380 --> 10:37.380
I'm incompetent.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.090
During the chaos of war,

10:39.370 --> 10:40.230
all of Jiangnan

10:40.360 --> 10:41.570
became a slaughterhouse,

10:41.570 --> 10:42.720
and I had no choice but to

10:42.720 --> 10:44.550
sell our ancestral salt fields hastily.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.160
But I do know about

10:45.160 --> 10:47.890
salt transportation and trading...

10:48.170 --> 10:48.970
I understand.

10:50.380 --> 10:52.000
You've come to request a job,

10:52.030 --> 10:52.440
right?

10:52.630 --> 10:53.390
That's right.

10:53.390 --> 10:54.460
First, to request a job;

10:54.460 --> 10:55.520
and second,

10:55.540 --> 10:56.390
to borrow some cash from you, Mr. Gu,

10:56.390 --> 10:58.380
for emergencies.

10:58.400 --> 10:59.720
How much do you want to borrow?

10:59.720 --> 11:00.720
I may not have that much cash

11:00.720 --> 11:01.380
to lend you.

11:01.480 --> 11:02.900
200 taels would be enough.

11:02.900 --> 11:04.610
I'm running short on chicken feed lately
as well.

11:04.610 --> 11:05.250
And

11:05.310 --> 11:07.060
the young man who went
beyond the pass to buy ginseng

11:07.060 --> 11:07.670
hasn't returned yet.

11:07.670 --> 11:08.690
I can only buy some in town

11:08.690 --> 11:09.750
and make do with it.

11:10.550 --> 11:11.770
Isn't that Mr. Pan?

11:13.240 --> 11:14.120
Don't leave yet.

11:14.120 --> 11:16.320
I happen to have something
to talk to you about.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.380
Why are you avoiding me?

11:17.380 --> 11:18.240
Did I offend you or what?

11:18.240 --> 11:18.970
Come on, sit.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.390
Mr. Pan here

11:24.440 --> 11:25.640
is quite a character.

11:26.120 --> 11:28.360
One night, he came to borrow money
from me.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.960
He came right at dinner time,

11:30.240 --> 11:31.960
so I asked him to join me for dinner,

11:31.960 --> 11:32.820
but he refused.

11:33.150 --> 11:33.820
He said

11:34.030 --> 11:35.720
he had just finished eating

11:35.790 --> 11:36.790
the five-spice beef cooked by

11:36.790 --> 11:38.120
the best chef in Suzhou.

11:38.280 --> 11:38.920
His stomach was,

11:38.920 --> 11:39.450
you know,

11:39.510 --> 11:40.320
completely stuffed,

11:40.320 --> 11:41.530
and he could only have a few drinks.

11:41.530 --> 11:43.080
So I said, let's have some drinks
together then.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.510
But after just two cups,

11:44.530 --> 11:45.460
Mr. Pan threw up.

11:45.550 --> 11:48.130
There was chaff all over the floor.

11:48.510 --> 11:49.170
S-Stop messing around.

11:49.170 --> 11:49.910
Stop it.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.200
I get it now.

11:51.320 --> 11:52.270
Maybe it was because

11:52.270 --> 11:53.240
"I ate beef,

11:53.390 --> 11:54.990
and the cow had eaten chaff."

12:05.370 --> 12:06.960
Your words were a bit too harsh.

12:06.960 --> 12:07.870
How hurtful.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.840
I just didn't want you to be fooled.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.510
Mr. Pan is addicted to opium.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.010
From head to toe,

12:14.030 --> 12:15.360
those clothes he was wearing

12:15.360 --> 12:16.510
are his most valuable possession.

12:16.510 --> 12:18.120
He's sold his wife and children,

12:18.120 --> 12:19.050
and he's been starving every day,

12:19.050 --> 12:20.850
running around to borrow money.

12:21.000 --> 12:22.680
Don't lend money to people like him.

12:22.680 --> 12:24.540
Alright. Thanks for the warning.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.150
How is your mother doing?

12:26.850 --> 12:28.150
She still hasn't woken up yet.

12:28.150 --> 12:29.280
I'm really worried.

12:29.910 --> 12:31.030
How are things on your side?

12:31.030 --> 12:33.120
We hired the best doctor in the capital,

12:33.120 --> 12:35.380
and he said phlegm had clouded his mind.

12:35.630 --> 12:36.880
I just can't believe it.

12:36.880 --> 12:38.600
My father has been sharp his whole life.

12:38.600 --> 12:40.800
How could his mind be clouded by phlegm?

12:41.030 --> 12:41.870
Tell me,

12:41.890 --> 12:43.150
what exactly was that about?

12:43.150 --> 12:44.410
You want me to tell you?

12:44.960 --> 12:47.090
I was meaning to ask you the same thing.

12:49.750 --> 12:50.790
My dear Pingyuan.

12:51.120 --> 12:51.850
It seems to me

12:51.870 --> 12:52.920
that your mother

12:53.150 --> 12:54.270
is doing slightly better

12:54.270 --> 12:55.130
than my father.

12:55.670 --> 12:57.140
How about you help me

12:57.240 --> 12:57.860
ask her what that was about

12:57.860 --> 12:58.920
after she wakes up?

12:59.270 --> 13:01.030
Given my mother's current condition,

13:01.030 --> 13:03.120
I wouldn't dare ask her
even if she wakes up.

13:03.120 --> 13:05.270
Why don't you go home
and try asking your father?

13:05.270 --> 13:06.510
I wouldn't dare ask him.

13:06.510 --> 13:08.040
I don't want to die just yet.

13:11.080 --> 13:11.670
However,

13:12.320 --> 13:14.670
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office
has been pressing us.

13:14.670 --> 13:16.510
If we keep hiding at home like this,

13:16.510 --> 13:19.040
they'll send soldiers
to arrest us tomorrow.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.280
I understand.

13:21.670 --> 13:23.670
Wait for me to grab something to eat.

13:53.240 --> 13:54.000
I'm going to the Viceroy's Office

13:54.000 --> 13:54.750
for work.

13:55.360 --> 13:57.000
I'll have to leave everything here to you.

13:57.000 --> 13:57.600
I'm here.

13:57.790 --> 13:58.520
Don't worry.

14:00.840 --> 14:01.640
I can't refuse

14:02.360 --> 14:03.220
this lousy job.

14:04.590 --> 14:05.620
Had I known,

14:06.000 --> 14:07.910
why would we have ever left our hometown?

14:07.910 --> 14:09.170
That's not your fault.

14:09.360 --> 14:10.550
They forced us out

14:11.150 --> 14:12.270
with guns.

14:12.720 --> 14:14.270
Anyway, I have no time for you now.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.550
I have to take care of Mother.

14:15.550 --> 14:18.150
Take good care of yourself and Heizi
on the way.

14:22.270 --> 14:23.750
You should also ask Pingwen and Miss Liao

14:23.750 --> 14:25.510
to come help you from time to time.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.910
Don't exhaust yourself.

14:26.910 --> 14:28.170
Don't say such things.

14:28.360 --> 14:29.720
Pingwen is too clumsy,

14:29.790 --> 14:31.480
and Miss Liao hasn't married into
our family yet.

14:31.480 --> 14:33.410
It won't hurt if I work a bit harder.

14:45.910 --> 14:47.640
What have I done to deserve you?

14:48.550 --> 14:49.880
It's enough to have you.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.780
I said, having you in this life

14:55.090 --> 14:55.690
is enough.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.830
What was that?

14:59.750 --> 15:00.390
Mother,

15:00.960 --> 15:02.760
I'm going on official business.

15:07.030 --> 15:07.550
I'm off.

15:19.120 --> 15:22.020
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

15:21.030 --> 15:22.630
-Greetings, Your Excellency.
-Greetings, Your Excellency.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.030
No need for formalities.

15:27.200 --> 15:28.790
You two have finally arrived.

15:28.790 --> 15:32.250
The Liangjiang Viceroy's Office
is honored by your presence.

15:33.510 --> 15:34.330
Your Excellency.

15:34.330 --> 15:36.550
The elders in our families
fell gravely ill.

15:36.550 --> 15:38.750
As children, we're truly heartbroken.

15:38.840 --> 15:40.900
Please forgive us, Your Excellency.

15:41.990 --> 15:43.260
Without you two here,

15:43.750 --> 15:46.080
Jiangning City has been in mixed spirits
as well.

15:46.080 --> 15:46.810
Gu Pingyuan,

15:47.150 --> 15:48.610
I still need to reward you.

15:53.790 --> 15:54.480
I wouldn't dare to accept that,
Your Excellency.

15:54.480 --> 15:55.270
You're too kind.

15:55.270 --> 15:57.350
The old businesses along Qinhuai River
have all been restored.

15:57.350 --> 15:58.430
As expected,

15:58.460 --> 15:59.730
it is teeming with visitors,

15:59.730 --> 16:01.600
and merchants come and go
in great numbers.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.630
The Complete Library of
the Four Treasuries

16:02.630 --> 16:04.720
republished by
the Jinling Publishing House

16:04.720 --> 16:06.240
is selling throughout the country.

16:06.240 --> 16:08.510
Scholars are as numerous as
fish crossing the river.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.200
I believe that within a year,

16:10.440 --> 16:13.080
the city will be fully restored
to its former glory.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.250
This achievement

16:14.360 --> 16:15.750
must be credited to you.

16:15.960 --> 16:18.240
You've demonstrated the unity
of civil and military strategy,

16:18.240 --> 16:20.170
a balance of restraint and action.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.750
Desperate times call for
desperate measures.

16:23.750 --> 16:24.270
Those were all

16:24.270 --> 16:26.270
methods not fit for public display.

16:26.750 --> 16:27.600
As the ancients said,

16:27.600 --> 16:29.840
"governing a great nation
is like cooking a small fish."

16:29.840 --> 16:30.870
How can that be called

16:30.870 --> 16:32.930
something unfit for public display?

16:32.960 --> 16:34.510
Appetite and desire are both natural.

16:34.510 --> 16:36.040
Starting from these basics

16:36.120 --> 16:37.580
is actually the Great Way.

16:37.830 --> 16:38.430
Exactly.

16:38.750 --> 16:39.510
When the two of us

16:39.510 --> 16:41.030
were entering Jiangning today,

16:41.030 --> 16:42.810
we already noticed it was
much more prosperous

16:42.810 --> 16:44.030
than when we left for Nantong.

16:44.030 --> 16:46.510
This is all thanks to
your strategic wisdom, Your Excellency.

16:46.510 --> 16:47.040
Alright,

16:47.080 --> 16:48.290
enough flattery.

16:48.440 --> 16:50.930
The Lianghuai Salt Field Guild

16:51.000 --> 16:52.440
has had the notice posted
for nearly half a month,

16:52.440 --> 16:53.930
yet you two were nowhere to be found.

16:53.930 --> 16:55.270
The former salt merchants of Lianghuai

16:55.270 --> 16:56.360
have been staying in inns,

16:56.360 --> 16:57.910
spending every day thinking up ways

16:57.910 --> 16:59.320
to bang drums and file lawsuits

16:59.320 --> 17:00.630
at the Viceroy's Office.

17:00.630 --> 17:02.430
Frankly, it's driving me crazy.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.890
Let's get things straight.

17:04.890 --> 17:06.240
I'm giving you 10 days

17:06.480 --> 17:07.740
to work out a solution.

17:08.510 --> 17:10.000
With government supervision
and merchant management,

17:10.000 --> 17:11.069
I'm now in control of

17:11.069 --> 17:12.349
the supervision part.

17:12.680 --> 17:14.880
If you can't get it done within 10 days,

17:15.400 --> 17:16.550
both of you, put on cangues

17:16.550 --> 17:17.880
and stand at my doorway.

17:18.200 --> 17:18.680
Alright.

17:18.680 --> 17:19.589
You should get going.

17:19.589 --> 17:21.270
I wouldn't dare waste

17:21.310 --> 17:23.640
the precious time of you great merchants.

17:26.510 --> 17:27.140
Let's go.

17:36.270 --> 17:36.830
Look.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.300
That old fox Rui Lin is so cunning.

17:39.300 --> 17:40.070
He's made the two of us

17:40.070 --> 17:41.130
like a pair of oxen—

17:41.310 --> 17:42.830
he won't spend a single penny,

17:42.830 --> 17:44.070
yet he's got ropes through our noses,

17:44.070 --> 17:45.130
pulling us around.

17:45.720 --> 17:46.920
This just isn't right.

17:46.920 --> 17:47.930
I'm worried too.

17:48.480 --> 17:50.090
How should we deal with
those old salt merchants

17:50.090 --> 17:51.620
from the Salt Fields Guild?

17:53.130 --> 17:54.470
I can't let them see me.

17:54.490 --> 17:55.900
With all due respect,

17:56.640 --> 17:58.120
my father

17:58.180 --> 17:59.200
seized their salt fields

17:59.200 --> 17:59.730
by force.

17:59.750 --> 18:00.720
Luckily, they don't know

18:00.720 --> 18:02.250
my father is bedridden now.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.530
Otherwise, they'd be swarming in

18:03.530 --> 18:04.790
to tear me apart alive.

18:06.170 --> 18:07.070
Our Li family

18:07.110 --> 18:08.030
now selects capable assistants

18:08.030 --> 18:09.300
from our shops each year

18:09.300 --> 18:10.160
and sends them out to become managers

18:10.160 --> 18:10.890
on their own.

18:11.450 --> 18:12.240
My father

18:12.240 --> 18:13.200
has gathered quite a few talented people

18:13.200 --> 18:14.320
for the salt field business.

18:14.320 --> 18:16.650
If you're short‑handed, just let me know.

18:16.880 --> 18:17.740
Thanks, buddy.

18:17.790 --> 18:18.400
Buddy?

18:19.680 --> 18:21.280
Our agreement still stands.

18:21.510 --> 18:23.160
If you can't outperform me
within 6 months,

18:23.160 --> 18:24.930
you'll have to hand over
the salt fields you're holding,

18:24.930 --> 18:27.400
so my father won't mock me
for being incompetent.

18:27.400 --> 18:28.660
I'm well aware of that.

18:28.720 --> 18:30.450
But what if I do outperform you?

18:31.110 --> 18:32.000
Don't worry about that.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.000
Just do your best.

18:33.550 --> 18:34.220
I certainly won't

18:34.220 --> 18:35.020
go easy on you.

18:35.720 --> 18:36.920
But one more thing:

18:38.180 --> 18:39.580
we'll always be buddies.

18:40.260 --> 18:41.120
I feel the same.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.000
What?

18:55.570 --> 18:56.550
I only asked you to follow me.

18:56.550 --> 18:58.310
Why are you sticking that close to me?

18:58.310 --> 18:59.510
You think I want to?

19:00.070 --> 19:01.680
I just helped you repair
the coastal embankment,

19:01.680 --> 19:03.610
and now I have to act as your escort.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.270
If Yu'er hadn't threatened me,

19:05.270 --> 19:05.790
what bastard would be willing to

19:05.790 --> 19:07.050
stay that close to you?

19:08.750 --> 19:09.900
Come on, tell me,

19:10.310 --> 19:11.710
what did Yu'er say to you?

19:12.550 --> 19:13.160
She said,

19:14.160 --> 19:15.510
if anyone comes in your way,
I'll shield you;

19:15.510 --> 19:16.670
if there's a knife coming at you,
I'll take the blow;

19:16.670 --> 19:18.060
if you cause any trouble,

19:18.060 --> 19:19.240
she'll pay with her life;

19:19.240 --> 19:20.590
if even a strand of your hair
falls from your head,

19:20.590 --> 19:22.010
I'll have to give my life for it.

19:22.010 --> 19:23.880
Listen, if you dare lose
even one strand of hair,

19:23.880 --> 19:25.810
I'll stick it right back in for you!

19:26.570 --> 19:27.400
Well, well.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.180
I've brought back a hothead.

19:31.210 --> 19:32.320
Listen, Heizi.

19:33.270 --> 19:34.840
If there's nothing else,

19:35.350 --> 19:37.010
you should go back to Nantong.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.400
What do you mean?

19:41.830 --> 19:43.290
Are you looking down on me?

19:44.320 --> 19:45.650
We're all scholars.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.030
Don't keep

19:47.050 --> 19:48.980
pulling out your knife to scare me.

19:49.490 --> 19:50.230
Fine, fine.

19:50.310 --> 19:52.510
If you don't want to go back, then don't.

19:53.470 --> 19:55.000
If you don't cause me trouble,

19:55.000 --> 19:56.930
I won't cause you trouble, either.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.130
Let's make sure this trip goes
smoothly and safely.

19:59.130 --> 20:00.270
I'll take you back safely

20:00.270 --> 20:01.240
without a scratch,

20:01.240 --> 20:02.500
and my job will be done.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.760
I believe you.

20:04.920 --> 20:05.990
After all, you, Heizi,

20:05.990 --> 20:07.650
are a man of your word.

20:08.960 --> 20:10.550
Stop buttering me up.

20:11.110 --> 20:11.750
As if I didn't know

20:11.750 --> 20:13.070
I'm a man of my word.

20:14.640 --> 20:15.350
Good man.

20:15.750 --> 20:17.080
I need a favor right now.

20:17.450 --> 20:18.580
Run an errand for me.

20:19.930 --> 20:24.490
[Gu Pingyuan] [Li Qin]

20:19.930 --> 20:24.490
[Salt Industry Guild]

20:28.880 --> 20:30.340
Let me tell you something.

20:30.840 --> 20:31.920
Listen, everyone.

20:32.150 --> 20:33.410
Gu Pingyuan and Li Qin,

20:33.700 --> 20:34.720
those two little bastards

20:34.720 --> 20:36.010
are trying to drive us

20:36.140 --> 20:38.330
Lianghuai salt merchants to our deaths.

20:38.330 --> 20:39.270
We need to find some

20:39.270 --> 20:40.510
court officials from Lianghuai,

20:40.510 --> 20:41.420
buy off a few of those lords,

20:41.420 --> 20:42.310
have them submit memorials

20:42.310 --> 20:43.000
to bring them down.

20:43.000 --> 20:43.930
Bring them down.

20:44.270 --> 20:46.000
What's the use of that?

20:46.880 --> 20:48.550
Right now in the Liangjiang region,

20:48.550 --> 20:50.800
Rui Lin has everything
under his thumb.

20:48.790 --> 20:52.130
[Tu Ying, Lianghuai Salt Merchant]

20:54.030 --> 20:55.630
But we can't just do nothing!

20:55.830 --> 20:57.720
Our family business has been passed down
for two or three centuries—

20:57.720 --> 20:58.750
how could it be wiped out

20:58.750 --> 21:00.010
over just a few scraps?

21:01.310 --> 21:02.170
This is just...

21:02.680 --> 21:04.410
I just can't wrap my head around

21:04.680 --> 21:05.680
how it ended up being

21:05.680 --> 21:07.590
the property of
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office!

21:07.590 --> 21:08.920
Where's the title deed?

21:09.830 --> 21:11.290
If you have the title deed,

21:11.440 --> 21:12.000
I'll go with you

21:12.000 --> 21:14.720
to file a lawsuit
at the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

21:14.720 --> 21:16.230
When under a low roof,

21:17.070 --> 21:18.590
one must bow their head.

21:20.550 --> 21:21.970
Gu Pingyuan and Li Qin!

21:22.160 --> 21:23.480
Those two bastards!

21:23.920 --> 21:25.920
Bastard! Who are you calling names?

21:27.830 --> 21:28.440
Who is this?

21:28.440 --> 21:29.500
Who is this person?

21:31.270 --> 21:32.120
Have you seen him before?

21:32.120 --> 21:33.110
Who is this person?

21:33.110 --> 21:33.990
Who is this?

21:34.020 --> 21:35.350
Have you met him before?

21:36.810 --> 21:38.510
Is this the Salt Industry Guild?

21:38.510 --> 21:39.110
Yes, it is.

21:39.270 --> 21:41.270
-Sir, you...
-Who's in charge here?

21:44.200 --> 21:45.160
Well...

21:45.510 --> 21:46.590
That would be me.

21:47.180 --> 21:48.960
My name is Tu on top and Ying below.

21:48.960 --> 21:49.890
Your name has 5 characters?

21:49.890 --> 21:50.890
No, 2 characters.

21:51.000 --> 21:51.930
Two characters.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.160
It's just Tu Ying.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.010
Sir, may I ask

21:54.110 --> 21:55.340
where you're from

21:55.370 --> 21:57.340
and what business you have with me?

21:58.030 --> 21:59.200
So you are...

21:59.240 --> 22:00.370
Are you done asking?

22:01.440 --> 22:02.610
Just call me Heizi.

22:03.030 --> 22:05.240
I'm Gu Pingyuan's big brother.

22:06.260 --> 22:07.520
Mr. Gu wants to see you.

22:07.750 --> 22:08.210
Please.

22:09.160 --> 22:09.920
So you're just a servant.

22:09.920 --> 22:11.720
I thought you were some big shot.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.610
Aren't you just

22:13.610 --> 22:14.830
Mr. Gu's servant?

22:14.880 --> 22:15.610
Just an errand boy.

22:15.610 --> 22:17.460
We members of the Salt Industry Guild

22:17.460 --> 22:18.270
have been here

22:18.310 --> 22:19.790
for over 20 days now.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.290
Everyone's family

22:21.510 --> 22:23.250
has been in the salt business

22:23.270 --> 22:24.930
for over 200 years.

22:25.320 --> 22:27.240
If he wants to profit from our industry,

22:27.240 --> 22:28.050
he should come here

22:28.050 --> 22:29.360
to pay us a visit first.

22:29.400 --> 22:30.160
Exactly!

22:30.510 --> 22:32.350
He should come in person

22:32.470 --> 22:33.260
to pay his respects.

22:33.260 --> 22:34.920
Otherwise, how could he possibly

22:34.920 --> 22:36.330
survive in the salt industry?

22:36.330 --> 22:37.660
Right, he won't make it!

22:40.160 --> 22:41.240
He's harming us salt merchants!

22:41.240 --> 22:42.320
Let him go home and play house.

22:42.320 --> 22:42.920
Exactly.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.430
Go home.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.920
Go home and play house!

22:46.920 --> 22:48.450
Just go home and play house!

22:54.920 --> 22:55.580
Easy, easy!

22:56.000 --> 22:57.060
What are you doing?

22:57.200 --> 22:57.830
What do you think you're doing?

22:57.830 --> 22:58.360
Sir!

22:58.510 --> 22:59.450
Sir. Sir.

22:59.720 --> 23:00.880
Gentleman. Gentleman.

23:00.880 --> 23:01.680
Easy, please.

23:01.770 --> 23:06.230
[Salt & Plum]

23:01.880 --> 23:02.240
Move!

23:03.270 --> 23:03.930
Gentleman,

23:04.160 --> 23:05.550
this is so indecent.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.210
Gentleman.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.370
Gentleman. Sir.

23:08.380 --> 23:09.310
[Salt & Plum]

23:08.440 --> 23:09.440
Sir, easy please.

23:10.480 --> 23:11.850
Oh my goodness.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.350
Mr. Tu,

23:13.540 --> 23:15.740
there's no need for such a grand salute.

23:17.110 --> 23:18.640
What are you talking about?

23:18.780 --> 23:20.420
You call this a salute?

23:20.650 --> 23:21.410
You, Gu,

23:21.790 --> 23:22.680
you really have no respect

23:22.680 --> 23:23.680
for others at all!

23:23.750 --> 23:24.480
Am I, Tu Ying,

23:24.500 --> 23:26.670
some street junkie

23:26.750 --> 23:27.880
or homeless person?

23:27.900 --> 23:29.360
Besides my salt business,

23:29.400 --> 23:30.070
I also run

23:30.110 --> 23:31.430
more than 10 silk shops.

23:31.430 --> 23:32.900
I'm here to stand up for
the salt merchants.

23:32.900 --> 23:33.840
Even His Excellency treats me

23:33.840 --> 23:34.860
with respect.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.590
You... I...

23:36.610 --> 23:38.270
Mr. Tu, please don't be angry.

23:38.490 --> 23:40.000
If he has offended you in any way,

23:40.000 --> 23:41.000
I apologize.

23:41.590 --> 23:42.550
You see, at the Salt Industry Guild,

23:42.550 --> 23:43.640
there are too many people and gossip.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.830
I wanted to ask for your advice,

23:44.830 --> 23:45.750
but it wasn't convenient there.

23:45.750 --> 23:47.020
That's why I specifically asked him
to invite you here.

23:47.020 --> 23:48.750
Is this how you invite someone?

23:49.680 --> 23:51.140
Look at the back of my neck!

23:51.440 --> 23:52.920
It's all swollen from his grabbing!

23:52.920 --> 23:54.380
Let me tell you something.

23:54.510 --> 23:56.030
From the Salt Industry Guild to here,

23:56.030 --> 23:58.420
my feet barely touched the ground.

23:58.640 --> 23:59.960
He grabbed me by the neck

23:59.960 --> 24:01.690
and dragged me all the way here!

24:01.750 --> 24:02.750
How could he do that?

24:02.750 --> 24:03.460
Heizi!

24:06.550 --> 24:07.150
It was him.

24:08.160 --> 24:09.680
Did I try to invite you or not?

24:09.680 --> 24:11.310
Full of nonsense since you came in.

24:11.310 --> 24:11.940
Want to go back, huh?

24:11.940 --> 24:12.510
Come on then.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.110
No, no, no!

24:13.400 --> 24:14.600
Let's talk properly.

24:14.750 --> 24:16.200
We're all educated people!

24:16.200 --> 24:16.640
Only use words

24:16.640 --> 24:19.040
that can be found
in the Kangxi Dictionary!

24:19.420 --> 24:22.360
[Everything as Wished]

24:21.590 --> 24:22.190
Everyone,

24:24.640 --> 24:26.240
I've invited you here today.

24:26.350 --> 24:27.350
I'm sure you already know why

24:27.350 --> 24:28.550
even if I don't say it.

24:28.610 --> 24:30.410
Let's get straight to the point.

24:30.880 --> 24:32.550
The salt industry of Lianghuai

24:32.550 --> 24:34.610
is the biggest business in Jiangnan.

24:34.790 --> 24:35.920
What can't common people

24:35.920 --> 24:36.830
live without?

24:37.920 --> 24:38.350
Salt.

24:38.960 --> 24:41.030
What can't armies do without in war?

24:41.920 --> 24:42.350
Salt.

24:42.790 --> 24:44.250
Even the war horses,

24:44.550 --> 24:46.870
if you don't add salt to their feed
at night,

24:46.870 --> 24:48.110
when they charge during the day,

24:48.110 --> 24:49.240
they won't run fast.

24:49.480 --> 24:51.190
So gaining control of salt

24:51.310 --> 24:54.030
means securing control of
our country's lifeline,

24:54.030 --> 24:56.030
which makes one an uncrowned ruler.

25:02.190 --> 25:03.190
[Liu's Caravan: 30 dan salt delivered]

25:03.190 --> 25:04.350
[Fu Man's Caravan: 120 dan salt delivered]

25:04.880 --> 25:06.480
After 10 years of fierce battles

25:06.480 --> 25:07.880
with tremendous losses,

25:08.840 --> 25:09.680
the salt fields in Lianghuai

25:09.680 --> 25:11.140
have long been abandoned.

25:11.830 --> 25:13.590
There's something I haven't been able to
figure out:

25:13.590 --> 25:14.720
for all these years,

25:15.030 --> 25:16.310
where has the salt eaten by
the people of Jiangnan

25:16.310 --> 25:17.400
been coming from?

25:19.070 --> 25:21.590
This matter cannot be discussed openly.

25:24.510 --> 25:26.310
Mr. Tu, if you don't speak today,

25:26.750 --> 25:28.830
you'll be hurting
your own people's future.

25:28.830 --> 25:29.880
As you know,

25:30.310 --> 25:31.910
I'm not in the salt industry.

25:32.030 --> 25:33.320
The Liangjiang Viceroy's Office
has asked me

25:33.320 --> 25:35.580
to temporarily oversee the salt fields.

25:35.800 --> 25:37.860
What His Excellency intends is that,

25:37.960 --> 25:38.960
if we want to maintan

25:38.960 --> 25:40.350
the vitality of
the Lianghuai salt industry,

25:40.350 --> 25:41.270
we can't let everything

25:41.270 --> 25:42.930
fall into Li Wantang's hands.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.600
That's why

25:44.110 --> 25:46.330
this six-month agreement was made.

25:45.410 --> 25:45.950
[Fu Man's Caravan: 120 dan salt delivered]

25:45.950 --> 25:46.550
[Goods In-and-Out Ledger]

25:47.310 --> 25:48.110
Today,

25:48.790 --> 25:51.030
if you refuse to tell me anything,
Mr. Tu,

25:51.030 --> 25:53.160
I'll have no choice but to
return empty-handed,

25:53.160 --> 25:54.290
hand over my duties,

25:54.480 --> 25:56.030
and say there's nothing I could do.

25:56.030 --> 25:56.790
For me,

25:57.270 --> 25:58.670
there's nothing to lose.

26:03.750 --> 26:05.410
The Lianghuai salt business—

26:05.640 --> 26:06.880
Mr. Gu,

26:07.720 --> 26:08.880
you'd just give such a massive deal up

26:08.880 --> 26:10.270
so easily?

26:10.830 --> 26:12.160
Who would believe that?

26:13.680 --> 26:15.200
Whether you believe it or not,

26:15.200 --> 26:16.260
it doesn't matter.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.200
My elderly mother at home

26:19.200 --> 26:20.460
is still unconscious.

26:21.070 --> 26:21.800
To be honest,

26:22.340 --> 26:23.800
I'm utterly heartbroken.

26:24.000 --> 26:25.440
I simply have no time or energy

26:25.440 --> 26:26.030
to get involved in

26:26.030 --> 26:27.960
all your scheming and infighting.

26:29.150 --> 26:30.010
How about this?

26:30.210 --> 26:31.410
When you go back,

26:31.740 --> 26:33.540
tell the Salt Industry Guild

26:34.070 --> 26:35.720
to file a complaint against me
at the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

26:35.720 --> 26:37.920
and have me removed from this position.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.320
I would be

26:40.350 --> 26:41.550
eternally grateful.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.150
Now that

26:48.030 --> 26:49.440
my father has assigned this task

26:49.440 --> 26:50.440
to me,

26:50.720 --> 26:52.450
I certainly can't let him down.

26:52.550 --> 26:54.110
Now, the salt administration

26:54.110 --> 26:56.170
of Jiangsu and Jiangxi is in my hands.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.030
The rest is managed by

26:57.030 --> 26:59.200
the representative of
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office,

26:59.200 --> 27:00.160
Gu Pingyuan.

27:00.830 --> 27:03.110
Those old fellows
in the Salt Industry Guild

27:03.110 --> 27:05.330
are making a big fuss at me,

27:05.440 --> 27:06.960
waiting for me to beg them.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.700
What they don't know is

27:09.480 --> 27:10.920
that my father has already

27:10.920 --> 27:12.050
got you all trained.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.840
I don't ask much of you.

27:14.510 --> 27:15.880
Just don't let me down

27:17.110 --> 27:18.260
and work diligently

27:18.550 --> 27:20.080
to outperform Gu Pingyuan.

27:20.830 --> 27:21.680
But if you don't

27:21.680 --> 27:22.740
have what it takes,

27:22.880 --> 27:24.110
just say so now.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.400
If you really leave us

27:26.510 --> 27:27.840
to deal with Li Wantang,

27:28.290 --> 27:30.960
we wouldn't even be enough
to fill a gap between his teeth!

27:30.960 --> 27:32.290
But if you don't help me,

27:32.640 --> 27:33.720
I can't win.

27:34.290 --> 27:35.490
If I lose,

27:35.670 --> 27:37.550
Li Wantang will manipulate

27:37.550 --> 27:38.550
the Salt Industry Guild

27:38.550 --> 27:39.280
to replace me

27:39.360 --> 27:40.490
with his own people.

27:41.320 --> 27:42.310
When that happens,

27:42.310 --> 27:43.360
I can just dust myself off

27:43.360 --> 27:44.790
and go back to Anhui to grow tea.

27:44.790 --> 27:45.850
But what about you?

27:46.510 --> 27:48.020
You'll be in real trouble.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.480
Well, I'll bet

28:13.960 --> 28:15.500
you're not a rat.

28:16.510 --> 28:17.810
Whether I'm a rat or not,

28:17.810 --> 28:19.340
we'll see about that later.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.140
The most urgent matter now

28:21.240 --> 28:22.100
is that, Mr. Tu,

28:22.590 --> 28:24.270
you need to tell me the truth.

28:25.760 --> 28:27.170
I'm not like my father.

28:28.730 --> 28:30.380
I have only two requirements for you.

28:30.380 --> 28:31.110
First,

28:31.640 --> 28:33.130
the money for repairing the salt fields

28:33.130 --> 28:34.170
is ready.

28:34.430 --> 28:35.590
When you arrive there,

28:35.590 --> 28:37.480
repair the salt field as fast as possible,

28:37.480 --> 28:38.590
hire assistants, secure lodgings,

28:38.590 --> 28:40.120
and open up shops for me.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.790
Throughout the Jiangsu and Jiangxi
regions,

28:41.790 --> 28:42.840
within 3 months,

28:42.960 --> 28:44.810
I want shops everywhere.

28:45.790 --> 28:46.400
Second,

28:47.510 --> 28:49.380
I'll give you another 3 months

28:49.480 --> 28:50.720
to expand into

28:50.750 --> 28:52.810
Gu Pingyuan's territory.

28:54.720 --> 28:56.650
I don't mind you spending my money.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.960
What I do mind is that
you lack the ability

28:58.960 --> 29:00.810
to put that money to good use.

29:03.070 --> 29:04.120
Is that clear?

29:05.200 --> 29:07.510
Yes, Young Master!

29:09.000 --> 29:10.310
Actually, the salt fields

29:10.310 --> 29:11.810
were not destroyed.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.240
When the Resistance Army was here,

29:15.240 --> 29:16.570
we kept doing business.

29:17.030 --> 29:18.400
Since we couldn't do business
with the imperial court,

29:18.400 --> 29:20.310
we did business with the Resistance Army.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.790
Besides, they paid us

29:22.110 --> 29:23.570
every copper coin in full.

29:23.590 --> 29:24.720
The problem was that

29:24.880 --> 29:26.680
the imperial court found out about this.

29:26.680 --> 29:27.800
The imperial court said

29:27.800 --> 29:29.290
we were aiding the rebels.

29:29.830 --> 29:31.890
No one could bear such an accusation.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.330
So some people,

29:33.510 --> 29:35.340
before Jiangning fell,

29:35.640 --> 29:37.030
whether deliberately

29:37.060 --> 29:38.290
or not,

29:39.310 --> 29:40.640
sold their salt fields.

29:41.110 --> 29:42.590
They were protecting themselves from

29:42.590 --> 29:44.830
future trouble with the imperial court.

29:44.830 --> 29:45.590
Li Wantang

29:45.610 --> 29:47.410
took advantage of that

29:48.060 --> 29:49.790
and acquired many salt fields.

29:50.350 --> 29:51.150
But of course,

29:51.200 --> 29:53.440
there were also some worthless people

29:53.680 --> 29:54.880
like that Pan fellow,

29:54.960 --> 29:56.810
who lost his fortune to opium

29:57.310 --> 29:58.040
and secretly

29:58.200 --> 29:59.750
sold his salt fields

30:00.240 --> 30:01.440
to Li Wantang.

30:02.070 --> 30:03.870
Things like that also happened.

30:05.640 --> 30:07.080
When we left,

30:07.720 --> 30:08.980
we pushed the mud walls

30:09.870 --> 30:11.350
into the salt fields,

30:12.240 --> 30:13.240
telling everyone

30:13.550 --> 30:14.570
that we abandoned them.

30:14.570 --> 30:16.600
You can't tell from the outside.

30:18.400 --> 30:19.070
I see.

30:20.190 --> 30:20.970
These are all

30:21.600 --> 30:23.820
just business tricks we use.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.440
It's not surprising

30:25.440 --> 30:26.640
that you didn't know.

30:27.160 --> 30:27.830
The shops

30:28.550 --> 30:30.200
and assistants are all still there.

30:30.200 --> 30:32.400
It's just that the title deeds are gone.

30:34.240 --> 30:35.240
I understand now.

30:36.110 --> 30:36.720
Mr. Tu.

30:37.720 --> 30:38.550
These days,

30:38.640 --> 30:40.270
I've been reviewing the ledgers.

30:40.270 --> 30:41.480
I have some ideas now

30:41.790 --> 30:43.590
and need your advice.

30:49.030 --> 30:50.110
At your command.

30:49.910 --> 30:51.810
[Goods In-and-Out Ledger]

31:21.110 --> 31:22.160
Too harsh.

31:38.470 --> 31:41.760
[Salt Industry Guild]

31:40.000 --> 31:41.800
I know what you all are thinking.

31:42.110 --> 31:43.310
You see that I'm young

31:43.510 --> 31:44.440
and an outsider,

31:45.080 --> 31:47.640
so you're worried I'll profit
from your industry, right?

31:47.640 --> 31:48.290
Or perhaps you think

31:48.290 --> 31:50.030
I'll be like Li Wantang,

31:50.110 --> 31:51.970
using the imperial court's power

31:52.680 --> 31:54.540
to seize your family businesses.

31:54.920 --> 31:55.780
Am I right?

31:57.200 --> 31:58.750
Since you all have doubts,

31:59.480 --> 32:00.680
feel free to speak up.

32:00.980 --> 32:02.420
If I can solve your problems,

32:02.420 --> 32:03.580
I'll do that;

32:03.750 --> 32:05.210
if I can't solve them,

32:05.660 --> 32:06.350
at worst,

32:06.460 --> 32:08.520
I'll give up my half of the salt fields

32:08.550 --> 32:09.310
to you all.

32:11.550 --> 32:12.530
I keep my word.

32:13.480 --> 32:15.590
I'm just temporarily
overseeing this duty anyway.

32:15.590 --> 32:17.790
Stepping aside for someone more capable

32:17.790 --> 32:19.250
is not out of the question.

32:20.830 --> 32:21.830
Please, ask away.

32:23.070 --> 32:24.400
Mr. Gu, have you ever made salt?

32:24.400 --> 32:24.830
No.

32:25.350 --> 32:26.790
Mr. Gu, have you ever run a salt shop?

32:26.790 --> 32:28.030
No, I haven't, either.

32:28.030 --> 32:29.590
Mr. Gu, do you plan to transport by water

32:29.590 --> 32:30.310
or by land?

32:31.520 --> 32:32.920
I haven't thought about that yet.

32:32.920 --> 32:34.240
Mr. Gu, back in the Canal Gang,

32:34.240 --> 32:35.030
what was your rank?

32:35.030 --> 32:35.550
Rank?

32:35.990 --> 32:37.130
No rank?

32:37.310 --> 32:38.410
Then you must've been an outsider.

32:38.410 --> 32:39.440
What do you mean outsider?

32:39.440 --> 32:40.640
Did you have a master?

32:41.900 --> 32:42.790
What master?

32:52.480 --> 32:53.480
Come in and speak.

32:53.640 --> 32:55.100
Well, Master is still ill.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.330
I'll tell you later.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.550
Even if you say it now,

32:57.550 --> 32:59.510
my father probably
won't be able to hear it.

32:59.510 --> 33:00.970
And even if he does hear it,

33:01.550 --> 33:02.830
I'm the young heir now.

33:04.240 --> 33:05.840
Just speak when I tell you to.

33:06.400 --> 33:06.920
Yes.

33:09.480 --> 33:11.280
It's about the salt field again.

33:11.550 --> 33:12.550
About that guy Gu Pingyuan...

33:12.550 --> 33:13.680
Call him Mr. Gu.

33:14.160 --> 33:15.690
You're not on his level yet.

33:16.790 --> 33:17.590
Young Master.

33:17.720 --> 33:19.680
The more someone competes with us,

33:20.350 --> 33:22.410
the more respect we should show them.

33:23.130 --> 33:24.030
Gu Pingyuan,

33:24.550 --> 33:26.040
even as a prisoner,

33:26.070 --> 33:28.330
has managed to stand toe-to-toe with us.

33:29.030 --> 33:30.960
Isn't that worthy of your respect?

33:32.110 --> 33:32.790
Yes.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.200
Mr. Gu

33:35.550 --> 33:37.270
has gathered all the former managers

33:37.270 --> 33:38.130
and assistants

33:38.790 --> 33:40.450
of the Lianghuai salt fields.

33:42.810 --> 33:44.470
He dares to hire those people?

33:44.750 --> 33:45.480
They're all

33:45.510 --> 33:46.960
wily old foxes.

33:49.350 --> 33:50.810
Can he really handle them?

33:51.480 --> 33:53.390
Look at you all,

33:53.640 --> 33:55.710
with such tiny, petty ambitions.

33:56.030 --> 33:56.750
I've told you

33:56.750 --> 33:58.170
that Mr. Gu has no experience.

33:58.170 --> 33:59.900
So what if he has no experience?

34:05.270 --> 34:06.470
Salt transportation

34:06.750 --> 34:08.110
is generally divided into two types:

34:08.110 --> 34:09.590
land transport

34:09.960 --> 34:11.270
and canal transport,

34:12.000 --> 34:14.440
and canal transport requires
the Canal Gang.

34:14.440 --> 34:16.020
All our former head managers

34:16.020 --> 34:16.949
joined the gang.

34:17.409 --> 34:18.159
This means

34:18.230 --> 34:19.090
you need to find someone

34:19.090 --> 34:20.360
older than you

34:20.510 --> 34:21.510
to be your master.

34:21.850 --> 34:23.310
This way, wherever you go,

34:23.760 --> 34:25.000
you won't be bullied.

34:27.110 --> 34:28.630
Even if you're not in the gang,

34:28.630 --> 34:30.420
you still have to claim you are.

34:30.550 --> 34:32.350
In the trade, this kind of person

34:32.750 --> 34:34.150
is called an "outsider."

34:35.510 --> 34:36.960
The rule of canal transport is:

34:36.960 --> 34:38.290
pretending is allowed,

34:38.360 --> 34:39.420
but denying is not.

34:39.710 --> 34:41.630
There's no crime in pretending,

34:41.960 --> 34:43.270
but if you do pretend,

34:43.920 --> 34:44.920
you can't deny it.

34:45.710 --> 34:47.170
Now along the Grand Canal,

34:47.190 --> 34:49.070
among hundreds of thousands of
Canal Gang members,

34:49.070 --> 34:51.670
most of them are "outsiders."

34:52.760 --> 34:54.070
I've learned something.

34:54.070 --> 34:55.199
So is this Canal Gang

34:55.440 --> 34:56.300
very powerful?

34:57.390 --> 34:58.120
Of course.

34:59.110 --> 35:01.840
Even Emperor Qianlong was once
a member of the gang.

35:01.840 --> 35:03.190
We still preserve

35:03.360 --> 35:05.220
the dragon-headed walking stick

35:05.280 --> 35:07.880
made of purple sandalwood
that Emperor Qianlong bestowed upon us.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.000
It's passed down

35:09.020 --> 35:10.590
as a token among successive gang Chiefs.

35:10.590 --> 35:11.710
However, Mr. Gu,

35:11.800 --> 35:12.730
with your status

35:13.190 --> 35:13.990
and position,

35:14.760 --> 35:16.360
it won't be hard to join the gang, right?

35:16.360 --> 35:18.070
Sure, sure. Not hard at all.

35:19.630 --> 35:21.430
Thank you all for your guidance.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.730
I'm a tea merchant.

35:24.190 --> 35:26.070
You could say I know absolutely nothing

35:26.070 --> 35:27.470
about the salt industry.

35:28.430 --> 35:28.880
Heizi.

35:29.260 --> 35:30.460
Bring out the gifts

35:30.510 --> 35:31.240
we prepared.

35:32.730 --> 35:34.330
He even brought gifts for us.

35:35.150 --> 35:36.480
This Gu Pingyuan is quite thoughtful.

35:36.480 --> 35:38.080
This is my own homegrown tea,

35:38.320 --> 35:39.650
called Orchid Snow tea.

35:41.040 --> 35:41.820
The Empress Dowager

35:41.820 --> 35:42.400
has bestowed upon it the title

35:42.400 --> 35:44.070
of "Top Tea Under Heaven."

35:44.160 --> 35:45.710
Top Tea Under Heaven?

35:45.960 --> 35:47.230
As this is our first meeting,

35:47.230 --> 35:48.400
please accept this small gift.

35:48.400 --> 35:50.370
Everyone, please take it home
and give it a try.

35:50.370 --> 35:53.390
[Orchid Snow]

35:53.420 --> 35:54.190
Mr. Gu.

35:54.440 --> 35:56.500
We all know you have good intentions,

35:56.670 --> 35:57.280
but good intentions

35:57.280 --> 35:59.230
are useless in business.

36:00.150 --> 36:01.360
The apprentices in salt shops

36:01.360 --> 36:03.510
need at least 3 years to
complete their training.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.410
Indeed.

36:04.480 --> 36:05.460
With just a few words from us,

36:05.460 --> 36:06.190
there's no way to turn you into

36:06.190 --> 36:06.880
an expert.

36:07.590 --> 36:08.230
Mr. Gu.

36:08.720 --> 36:09.670
You're too young—

36:09.670 --> 36:11.400
you're no match for Li Million.

36:11.840 --> 36:12.440
Everyone.

36:13.930 --> 36:14.840
I may never become

36:14.840 --> 36:16.370
an expert in this lifetime.

36:18.070 --> 36:19.330
But it doesn't matter.

36:20.760 --> 36:21.890
What matters is that

36:22.920 --> 36:24.550
all of you here are experts.

36:25.310 --> 36:27.070
His Excellency personally told me

36:27.070 --> 36:29.030
that he wants the salt industry profits
made in Lianghuai

36:29.030 --> 36:30.480
to stay in Lianghuai.

36:32.710 --> 36:33.680
Therefore,

36:33.710 --> 36:34.900
this battle between Li Wantang and me

36:34.900 --> 36:36.230
isn't one I'm fighting—

36:36.670 --> 36:38.270
it's you who're fighting it.

36:38.670 --> 36:40.300
And you must win this battle for me,

36:40.300 --> 36:42.040
and for yourselves!

36:42.670 --> 36:44.870
Starting today, I'm setting a new rule:

36:45.030 --> 36:47.000
for all salt shops,

36:47.320 --> 36:49.030
we'll split the net profit 30-70.

36:49.030 --> 36:50.300
-30-70?
-30-70?

36:50.510 --> 36:51.400
I'll take 30%,

36:52.440 --> 36:53.630
and you'll take 70%.

36:53.740 --> 36:54.400
How's that?

36:55.190 --> 36:56.040
Mr. Gu,

36:56.710 --> 36:58.600
are you joking with us?

36:58.760 --> 37:00.210
The boss takes 30%

37:00.320 --> 37:01.700
and the staff take 70%?

37:02.110 --> 37:03.940
Isn't that completely upside down?

37:03.940 --> 37:04.710
When I do business,

37:04.710 --> 37:05.930
I never joke.

37:06.110 --> 37:06.800
As long as

37:06.840 --> 37:08.150
I'm still in this position,

37:08.150 --> 37:09.920
this rule will never change.

37:10.070 --> 37:11.230
-Great!
-Excellent!

37:11.230 --> 37:11.960
Mr. Gu,

37:12.230 --> 37:13.710
we'll fight this battle with you

37:13.710 --> 37:14.700
and win it!

37:14.840 --> 37:15.840
For Mr. Gu,

37:15.960 --> 37:17.230
we'll win this battle!

37:18.030 --> 37:19.630
Let me say this one last time.

37:19.800 --> 37:21.260
It's not about me winning.

37:21.590 --> 37:23.280
It's about you winning!

37:27.530 --> 37:30.570
[600 copper coins per bundle]

37:30.500 --> 37:32.210
Mr. Gu said to lower it
by another 100 copper coins.

37:30.570 --> 37:33.280
[Gu's Salt Shop]

37:32.400 --> 37:32.800
Got it.

37:33.380 --> 37:35.820
[500 copper coins per bundle]

37:35.400 --> 37:36.400
500 copper coins.

37:37.070 --> 37:38.710
Today we're changing the price to...

37:38.710 --> 37:40.310
300 copper coins per bundle.

37:40.440 --> 37:41.370
Go and notify all shops

37:41.370 --> 37:43.480
to change it immediately
and not wait until dark.

37:43.480 --> 37:43.960
Yes.

37:45.070 --> 37:45.730
Stop there!

37:49.230 --> 37:50.030
Young Master.

37:50.400 --> 37:52.060
We can't do business this way.

37:52.120 --> 37:53.000
If you keep competing like this,

37:53.000 --> 37:54.200
when will it ever end?

37:54.340 --> 37:56.310
The salt brought out from the salt fields
already costs 300 copper coins,

37:56.310 --> 37:57.760
with food for people
and feed for horses on the way,

37:57.760 --> 37:59.000
plus all these labor and material costs—

37:59.000 --> 38:00.800
nobody does business like this!

38:08.480 --> 38:09.800
So how do you think

38:10.670 --> 38:12.400
we should do business?

38:14.710 --> 38:16.030
Anyway, if Master were conscious,

38:16.030 --> 38:17.760
he would never approve of this.

38:18.710 --> 38:19.230
Aren't you just

38:19.230 --> 38:20.960
shooting yourself in the foot?

38:21.320 --> 38:22.000
Running the shops for one day

38:22.000 --> 38:23.030
with all these resources

38:23.030 --> 38:23.550
will cost

38:23.550 --> 38:24.840
nearly 100,000 taels of silver.

38:24.840 --> 38:26.230
Is 100,000 taels a lot?

38:28.590 --> 38:30.110
Of course it's a lot!

38:30.440 --> 38:31.250
You haven't even

38:31.250 --> 38:33.250
earned that much from the shops yet.

38:44.510 --> 38:44.960
Fine.

38:46.190 --> 38:46.790
Fine then.

38:52.230 --> 38:52.820
Young Master,

38:52.820 --> 38:54.820
you really can't compete like this.

38:56.920 --> 38:57.720
Young Master,

38:57.920 --> 38:59.730
please don't be childish.

38:59.800 --> 39:00.760
He's an amateur—

39:01.000 --> 39:02.400
do you want to be one too?

39:03.370 --> 39:04.630
I am an amateur indeed.

39:06.520 --> 39:06.960
But...

39:07.720 --> 39:09.200
When the Master wakes up,

39:09.220 --> 39:11.420
how am I supposed to explain this to him?

39:12.670 --> 39:13.890
Haven't I told you

39:13.920 --> 39:14.710
that before my father wakes up,

39:14.710 --> 39:15.550
I'm the boss?

39:15.570 --> 39:18.030
I don't need you to teach me
how to do business.

39:18.030 --> 39:18.670
Besides,

39:19.050 --> 39:20.440
if I didn't know how, I would ask you.

39:20.440 --> 39:22.370
If you make a scene in public again,

39:22.630 --> 39:24.070
I'll send you packing

39:24.110 --> 39:24.890
back to the capital.

39:24.890 --> 39:25.960
Do you understand?

39:28.030 --> 39:29.880
Also, is 100,000 taels of silver a lot?

39:29.880 --> 39:30.230
Sure it is.

39:30.230 --> 39:31.550
So who do you think can afford that,

39:31.550 --> 39:32.580
us or Gu Pingyuan?

39:32.960 --> 39:33.800
My approach is

39:33.820 --> 39:34.750
to settle this with him

39:34.750 --> 39:35.610
within 10 days.

39:35.940 --> 39:37.070
Six months is too long.

39:37.070 --> 39:39.400
I don't have that much time
to waste on him.

40:18.900 --> 40:21.250
[My name is Chang Yu'er.
Husband Gu Pingyuan.]

40:25.900 --> 40:28.300
Why didn't you tell me
you were coming back?

40:28.320 --> 40:30.160
I thought I'd come back to check
if Mother's awake yet.

40:30.160 --> 40:31.230
There's no point in checking.

40:31.230 --> 40:32.110
Come on, let's go.

40:32.110 --> 40:32.480
Let's go.

40:32.480 --> 40:33.940
What are you writing here?

40:34.150 --> 40:35.140
Nothing. It's nothing.

40:35.140 --> 40:37.140
What's this "Husband Gu Pingyuan"?

40:37.230 --> 40:38.680
I-It's nothing.

40:38.830 --> 40:39.480
Let me see.

40:41.200 --> 40:42.190
Go quickly. Weren't you going to check...

40:42.190 --> 40:43.520
How about I check on you?

40:46.890 --> 40:47.820
Check on me then.

40:59.590 --> 41:00.300
I'll go make you something to eat.

41:00.300 --> 41:00.960
Move aside.

41:21.000 --> 41:22.930
It's tea harvesting season again,

41:23.630 --> 41:24.760
yet we can't go back.

41:28.150 --> 41:30.010
If Mother's health were better,

41:30.960 --> 41:33.560
I'd really want to take Mother
back to Huizhou.

41:33.840 --> 41:35.640
Didn't you find someone to help?

41:35.960 --> 41:37.220
What's the use of that?

41:38.190 --> 41:40.050
Mr. Liao isn't going back either.

41:40.840 --> 41:43.150
This year, we won't even
be able to harvest

41:43.150 --> 41:44.950
a single tael of Orchid Snow tea.

41:46.320 --> 41:47.480
Brew some tea from home

41:47.480 --> 41:49.010
for Mother to taste as well.

41:49.230 --> 41:51.560
Don't let her drink medicine all the time.

42:12.070 --> 42:12.920
Go eat.

42:13.480 --> 42:14.940
Father is waiting for you.

42:16.070 --> 42:17.870
Mr. Chang must've been worried.

42:22.150 --> 42:24.000
If we're talking about transporting salt

42:24.000 --> 42:24.960
by land,

42:25.150 --> 42:26.480
that's a simple matter.

42:27.150 --> 42:29.440
I've been running the horse gang
my whole life.

42:29.440 --> 42:30.900
The amount of salt you have

42:30.920 --> 42:32.000
would only take one horse caravan

42:32.000 --> 42:33.070
making 3 to 5 trips

42:33.190 --> 42:34.320
to transport it all.

42:36.070 --> 42:36.800
I think

42:37.440 --> 42:38.900
the most urgent matter now

42:39.030 --> 42:41.030
is that the salt price isn't rising.

42:41.280 --> 42:43.030
If you keep pushing yourself like this,

42:43.030 --> 42:44.630
when will it ever end?

42:46.150 --> 42:47.190
I want to transport salt

42:47.190 --> 42:47.810
from Sichuan.

42:47.810 --> 42:48.470
Si... Si...

42:49.110 --> 42:50.000
Sichuan?

42:50.710 --> 42:52.570
Although Sichuan's well salt

42:52.630 --> 42:53.630
is cheap indeed,

42:54.360 --> 42:55.550
what you're engaged in now

42:55.550 --> 42:56.960
is a price war.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.600
Don't tell me

43:00.000 --> 43:01.280
you're thinking of
trafficking illegal salt.
